@startuml credit-application
title Credit application
|Customer|
start
:Submit credit application;
|Credit officer|
:Check completeness;
if (Complete?) then (yes)
  |Risk engine|
  :Score applicant;
  if (Score sufficient?) then
    :Approve credit;
  else
    :Reject application;
  endif
else (no)
  :Request missing documents;
endif
|Credit officer|
:Inform customer;
@enduml
